SUMMARY:Double Double Trouble: Violin and Piano
DESCRIPTION:AmiciMusic presents Double Double Trouble\, a sequel to a program they performed at the Museum last summer.  Violinists Emmanuel Borowsky from Baltimore and Glen Mouat from Scotland\, return to perform with pianist/artistic director Daniel Weiser.  They will perform exciting and passionate music by Handel\, Sinding\, Sarasate\, Frolov\, and more. \nPurchase Tickets
